{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a0b0df580b5e6d693bd90b86a076a0dbfc2c0959f40ee4f25ae9e8d5e998b123", "ja": "（アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が\nそろそろ始まる。歩も準備が終わる頃かな）", "zh": "（偶像写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄差不多要开始了。步也快准备好了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "91ecbc89d740946f67c5f1c52e146f6a0ca0beef210b9284314b24a61d56e213", "ja": "うぅ……この衣装、ちょっと恥ずかしいね。\nなんか、自分じゃないみたいっていうか……。", "zh": "呜……这套服装，感觉有点不好意思呢。\n总觉得，有点不像我自己……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5e0ed0b9f9d72e8c88130a733288b64f2f35a7676929f6fe48e9286bf71df712", "ja": "そうか？　よく似合ってると思うけど。\n本当にカフェにいてもおかしくなさそうだよ。", "zh": "这样吗？我觉得很适合你啊。\n就算真的待在咖啡馆里，也一点都不奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7dc7adda3c5dba75c8607dbb08aa1aa15703cd081c7761b3d363239adc04bdf3", "ja": "アタシが？　そっか……へへ。", "zh": "我？这样啊……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb60c9994030bddb0245f352ba80a62dd99c0960d8457d822a5cb2677638f62b", "ja": "うん、いい感じだと思う。\nその調子で、撮影も可愛く頼んだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得感觉很棒。\n保持这个状态，拍摄时也要可爱一点，拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8039a13c96f52679637ee017a2da15fe810ff3102cde4111191b3439f2e86622", "ja": "あ、あはは……やっぱそういう感じ？\nアタシって、カワイイのは慣れてないからさ～……。", "zh": "啊，啊哈哈……果然还是这种感觉吗？\n我啊，不太习惯可爱风格嘛～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "49ca5d11a60bcb221a13530569313f0c5af99fd1db74b6e7a601d12dce299a4f", "ja": "今日の撮影は、カッコよく！ってならないかな～って、\nちょっと思ってたんだけどなぁ。", "zh": "我刚才还在想，今天的拍摄能不能走帅气风呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c1e6e48dfd143e0754edaa516a59e5fc7edbb932eb8f5a3d853902ba914c0f0", "ja": "だからこそだよ。いつもとは\n違う歩を見せていくってのも大事だと思うぞ。", "zh": "正因为如此啊。展现与平时不同的阿步，我觉得也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e8990a6a9c9005200db8183ebec151ed3d5bb0d9385d7c5d141cb251a1f9bf2", "ja": "たしかに……。\nせっかくこういう衣装を着てるんだもんな……。", "zh": "确实……。\n难得穿着这样的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9898a5289b0fc71b744c9ee05d03fbe79c2eee953c48639e9e2984686460982b", "ja": "よし……カワイイウェイトレス、アタシやるよ！\nちょっと練習してみる！", "zh": "好……可爱的女服务员，我来当！\n我先来练习一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "98cbe3736d9dec4de6242aeaed5a19679c36125cd2b86626807dcb35464a4625", "ja": "と、特製わさびバーガーは、どうかなっ？　\nアタシのおすすめ！だよ♪　な、なんて……どう？", "zh": "那、那个……特制芥末汉堡，怎么样？\n这是我推荐的哦♪ 怎、怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6884632f098c266cb62e7ddc11050993c863be0fb9730e5c1276903982274d01", "ja": "えっと……。歩が恥ずかしいと思ってるってのは、\nよく伝わってきたかな……。", "zh": "那个……我好像充分感受到步觉得害羞这件事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "acb6a40bbcb5299a3b52d7bb83982c3c90ca424e88dd0c63cfde0b1b05468105", "ja": "うぅ……言ってて、アタシっぽくないなぁって\n思っちゃうんだよ～！", "zh": "呜呜……说出来的时候，连自己都觉得\n这一点都不像我啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1013_p", "source_sha256": "78242349c9174d426a171c445172050fec26254a3c85a479e628fff9ad5cea5b", "ja": "とにかくイメージしてみよう。いいか？　歩は今、\n行列のできるカフェの看板ウェイトレスだ。", "zh": "总之，先试着想象一下。听好了，步现在是那家排起长队的咖啡店的招牌女服务生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ec50946ca71a4b199408c4e004a807c3649674c9508666763254b49b04829af6", "ja": "むむ、イメージ、イメージ……えっと……うん。\nおすすめのメニューはいかがですか～？　えへっ♪", "zh": "唔唔，想象，想象……呃……嗯。\n请问要不要试试推荐菜品呀～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1015_p", "source_sha256": "04e7c6573b3481fa7b0901ef82f7a2899008ab79f446b6832bca04a680123d43", "ja": "おっ！　いいじゃないか。自然だったよ。", "zh": "哦！这不是挺好的吗？很自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41f02aafe42849c30a9fe71f75d38475176dd8b2589963e02c9c7ce52b1f292c", "ja": "ホントに？　そっか、今の感じか……！\nうん！　ありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "真的？这样啊，原来是这种感觉……！\n嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a44e2a035508c6a2bd7e9f763c9a6f71c43099b794c670ddf6877ae6c394299d", "ja": "アタシ、カワイイウェイトレスとして、\n突っ走れそうな気がしてきたよ！", "zh": "我感觉自己作为可爱的女服务生，已经可以一路冲下去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b343fa32ac601f3914d7cee68c8d199cfcdaec7d24b7d9303d3b7108f28f3891", "ja": "えへ……い、いらっしゃいませ♪\nお席へご案内しますねっ。こちらへどうぞ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿……欢、欢迎光临♪\n我带您去座位，请往这边来～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0243_1019_p", "source_sha256": "10a895d59b5f63f8359e1e816c076e3cdf9cc9a41460cde9fd4a39e6ebd9db2c", "ja": "（多少の照れは残っていたが……だからこそ初々しい、\n歩ならではの撮影になった。やったな、歩！）", "zh": "（虽然还残留着些许害羞……但正因如此，才拍出了只有步才有的青涩感。干得漂亮，步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
